{"words": [{"text": "يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ", "translation": "They ask you"}, {"text": "عَنِ", "translation": "about"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنفَالِ ۖ", "translation": "the spoils of war"}, {"text": "قُلِ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنفَالُ", "translation": "The spoils of war"}, {"text": "لِلَّهِ", "translation": "(are) for Allah"}, {"text": "وَٱلرَّسُولِ ۖ", "translation": "and the Messenger"}, {"text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translation": "So fear"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَأَصْلِحُوا۟", "translation": "and set right"}, {"text": "ذَاتَ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "بَيْنِكُمْ ۖ", "translation": "(which is) between you"}, {"text": "وَأَطِيعُوا۟", "translation": "and obey"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ", "translation": "and His Messenger"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كُنتُم", "translation": "you are"}, {"text": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "believers"}], "sahih": "They ask you, [O Muḥammad], about the bounties [of war]. Say, \"The [decision concerning] bounties is for Allāh and the Messenger.\" So fear Allāh and amend that which is between you and obey Allāh and His Messenger, if you should be believers."}